# The repo-root .gitignore ignores `.env` everywhere. The playground is a throwaway
# fixture app that must boot with zero setup, so it is negated here — and only here.
# Never copy this negation into a real application.

!.env
.env.local
.env.production.local
.env.development.local

# Assembler regenerates these route/entity type indexes on every `serve` and `test`
# run, and nothing in this app imports them (no `indexEntities` hook, no `#generated/*`).
.adonisjs
